@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002/api/v1
@accessToken = replace-after-login

### A local password is required. Do not commit real credentials in this file.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "replace-with-local-password"
}

### Paste the access token returned by login above.
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### The REST Client reuses the refresh_token cookie from the login response.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh

### Revokes the current refresh-token session and clears its cookie.
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
